[E0414] Error: cannot assign to `h.text` while the bindings of a `val` pattern refer to it
    ╭─[ err/189_owned_guard_bindings/main.wip:13:5 ]
    │
 10 │     val .Some(text) = h.text else {
    │                       ───┬──  
    │                          ╰──── matched here; the bindings refer to it until the block ends
    │ 
 13 │     h.text = .None
    │     ───┬──  
    │        ╰──── assigned here
